# Defibrillating Current with its only target gone: Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on its own Llanowar Elves, so the
# Current has no legal target when it would resolve, is countered by the rules (CR 608.2b), and Bot1 gains no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Defibrillating Current
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Island x3
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x3
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Defibrillating Current.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Defibrillating Current
